WEBVTT

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:05.880
The Dream Parade was so much fun.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.980
I'm so glad for you all.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.850
You were shining pretty well.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.670
I could even say you were amazing.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.730
Thanks, Non.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:19.560
But in my idol rankings,

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.200
you're still second.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.040
Second?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.500
Number one is Falulu-sama!

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.390
And everyone else is number two!

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:30.860
So everyone else is number two.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.890
And Hibiki-san is third!

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.650
Hibiki-san? Why?

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:40.270
She's pretty perfect in looks and talent but

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.010
her character isn't very good.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.580
I-I see...

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:49.980
Everyone! I'm so happy toda...

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.200
I mean I have something important to tell you.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:01:00.400
The Art Teacher Kiki Ajimi, who took over the role for half a year is returning to EuroPara!

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.540
I was, but

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.890
I'm actually staying-daVinci!

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.010
I'm staying right here.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.550
I want to spend more time with you all!

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.870
I'm starting all over again with Curly-chan daVinci!

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:18.870
You say you're staying!?

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:22.490
Da vinci!
In that case...

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:25.570
I will go home,

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:26.850
to EuroPara.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.430
Hibiki-san is going to EuroPara?

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:34.530
I've got a lot of work to do in PriParis.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.040
No way!

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.690
Hibiki-sama!

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:40.930
You catch on quickly.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:44.790
It's okay, you can see me on PriPara TV anytime.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.760
I can't believe even Hibiki-san is...

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:50.940
Ever since Falulu said she was going back...

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.760
And we had just become friends...

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.880
That's not a very friendly thing to do.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:35.980
Everyone's Friends!
Everyone's an Idol!

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.260
Excuse us!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.200
What's wrong, everyone?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.160
Fuwari, you're here too?

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:48.620
We've brought a parting letter for you.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:49.990
Here you go.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:53.040
I don't want it!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.010
We give parting gifts here!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.800
Because we're friends!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:03.070
There are no elementary schools that <i>don't</i> give parting gifts!

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:05.200
It's the basic etiquette of basic etiquette!

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:09.110
You're our good friend, we just can't bear to be apart from each other.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.820
Yeah, friends!

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:13.620
Not just friends, <i>best </i>friends.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.360
Don't include me in your elementary school games!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:21.750
The winds of change move slowly,
trauma takes time to heal.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:26.120
Even though she's reformed,
her personality isn't changed so easily.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.990
What's up with you, we even put you in our plans!

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.910
Dorothy, relax!

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.870
I want to be included in the farewell party.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.920
Fuwari, do you mean...

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:43.180
Yes, I'm going home with Hibiki-san to EuroPara.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.710
You're going too!?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.230
This wasn't in the prophecy!

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:50.740
Why!?

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.330
Because I'm worried about her.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.100
I see.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.010
Ah, I remember...

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:02.370
It's your birthday soon, right Hibiki-san?

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.670
Then now is the perfect time!

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:08.160
A farewell and birthday party!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.620
Just stop, I'm <i>not</i> doing it!

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.730
She's not changed at all!

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:17.420
She's boring...

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.270
We've not given up!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.860
If anything, this just motivates me more.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:28.010
I'll hold the most embarrassing farewell and birthday party ever seen in the history of PriPara!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.420
How does one "move"?

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:44.850
Make sure to stay healthy over there.

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:46.410
Okay.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:51.730
That's the only slovenly habit of yours I couldn't fix.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.630
True, Ookanda-sensei.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:58.960
I'm happy we'll be together in PriParis again.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:04.170
I'm also happy that Fuwari is coming, as I'll have more friends.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.690
But the thing I'm most happy about is

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:09.890
that you're smiling, Maho-chan.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.640
Thank you, Princess Falulu.

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:18.060
You are, my gem.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:43.790
(Sentence enders)

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:50.900
Hibiki-san! Happy Birthday!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.920
W-What on earth...

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.220
Wait, this is...

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.210
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:07.670
Shikyouin Hibiki's birthday and
farewell party is beginning now!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.070
W-What!?

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:13.620
Solami Smile will be MCing today's event!

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:15.990
Let's have a blast-pri!

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:21.180
And now, let's introduce who this party is all for.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:25.700
Falulu, Hibiki-san and Fuwari!

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:29.290
Firstly, bouquets!

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:34.930
Handing them over will be the team who chased the Phantom Thief, the PriPara Police!

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:38.960
By the way, I'm one of them!

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:47.250
The eternally undying PriPara Police are here-daVinci!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:53.290
I can't take this much sentence enders!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:02.530
Hibiki, please give us a few words on being hunted-pri!

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:05.210
I'm expecting comments about your thievery-pri.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:07.220
I can't hear the sentence enders!

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.690
These anti-sentence ender earphones are working!

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:15.490
From you, it was like taking candy from a baby.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:20.060
A lot happened, but you were good at what you did-ender.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.140
Congratulations-ender!

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:28.410
The PriPara police are still going strong-daVinci!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:30.530
The PriPara Nurses are too.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:35.070
Ando, you should be in the building.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:37.450
Where are you?

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.540
Be well!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:44.520
Don't forget Parajuku after you've gone!

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:48.400
Shion's Four-character idiom for her departing friends!

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.440
Take it away!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:53.970
You only live once!

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:57.010
An important chance only comes once.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.180
Shikyouin, Fuwari and Falulu.

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:03.440
All the best to my good friends! Farewell!

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:08.410
They say Wood Ear are mushrooms don't they?

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.920
Falulu, Fuwari and Maho-chan!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.870
Don't forget our lovely flavor!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.730
Hibiki-san, be happy with Fuwari.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.780
I'll turn this one snake, in to two!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:40.580
Relax! He shedded earlier!

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:46.940
I couldn't make you refined at all...

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:52.370
Hibiki-san, from now on, I hope that your talent

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:54.530
will be fully demonstrated!

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.480
Thanks.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.730
I'll take these as a memento.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.160
W-Why those...

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.290
Time for the farewell address-pri!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.980
Our good friend Hibiki-san.

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:18.020
Falulu, Fuwari!

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.360
I want to see you again!

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.740
We've been through a lot.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.680
But we'll

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.640
always be together!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:48.710
It's the birthday and farwell party for Shikyouin Hibiki!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:52.770
Are you all having fun!?

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.510
What about you, Hibiki-san?

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.830
She's so happy she can't even speak!

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:07.730
And now, it's time for the unhappy bird who became happy, Toriko!

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:12.050
The path for Toriko is bright!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:16.320
Toriko is getting smarter!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.890
Toriko is optimistic-kuma!

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:21.920
It's because they're going to PriParis with Fuwari-usa.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:25.850
It's obvious they're happy, this is a huge step for them-nekon.

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:30.580
Ko is for...
TL Note: Toriko can't remember her line for "Ko", as oppsed to "To" and "Ri"

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.950
L-Loneliness? Trouble?

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.060
No!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:38.270
Um, Ko is for, Ko is for...

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:41.220
(Unknown reference)

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:46.650
Never thought that would happen-kuma...

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.640
I guess they aren't used to being optimistic after all-usa...

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:54.360
As I thought, I'm doomed to eternal unhappiness-tori!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:59.620
Damnit, where did you go Ando?

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:02.530
Hibiki, what's wrong?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:14.990
When I look at you, I remember my old self.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.470
Your old self?

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:20.240
Laughing loudly while playing,

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:23.730
playing tag innocently with my old friends.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.090
That's why,

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:30.770
I was drawn to you.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:39.980
Maybe I wasn't searching for a princess,
but a friend back then.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.590
A friend?

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.270
I see...

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:46.660
So that's why Maxi led you to me.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:49.780
You might be right.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.980
I wonder where Ando-san went...

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.170
Ah, now that you mention it, Ando.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:02.200
"Even if it's only once, I want to see you in feminine clothing" he said.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:04.470
That's it Hibiki-san!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.410
Wearing feminine clothes?

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:09.970
Hibiki-sama is?

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.020
No way!

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:13.430
What's happening?

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.520
Hibiki is wearing feminine clothes apparently!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:20.360
But Hibiki-san is a girl,

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.810
so it's not exactly... shocking-pri?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.860
Is that Hibiki-sama?

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.700
I want to see more!

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:44.930
Hibiki-sama looks great dressed in feminine clothes,

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.410
but her masculine appearance is good too.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:49.760
I'm divided.

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:53.560
Get him!

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.190
Pshuuuu.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:59.440
Got you.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.030
Hibiki-sama...

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.760
Ando, I'm sorry.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.070
Please come back.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:08.850
Hibiki-sama,

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.240
I appreciate those words.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.130
I'm so sorry.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:21.560
Thank you so much!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:24.620
Celebrate for me, and thanks!

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.340
This is my gift!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.380
So that's all of it

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:33.640
Hibiki-san.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:37.270
After this, I'll be cashing in that promise, okay?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.450
You're really going to do it?

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:46.800
Hibiki-sama you're amazing!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.010
Let's go!

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:58.070
Did you drop the gold Hibiki statue,

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.700
or the silver Hibiki statue?

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:04.570
I dropped the wood-carved Hibiki statue!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.490
Stop joking and come over here.

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:16.350
I showed you my great sense of humor, and this...

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.590
Don't be like that.

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:54.850
Let's take this party to the next level!

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:57.150
Lots of lively cords!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.660
Smile! The Sky! The Sun!

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.470
March Cord!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.530
Bye bye everyone!

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.970
We'll meet again-pri!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:13.600
Bye bye Curly-chan!

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.370
We're friends forever-daVinci!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.560
Bye bye! See you later!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:24.080
Bye bye, Garuru will do her best!

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.110
Garuru?

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:26.770
Why are you here?

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:30.740
Let's give it our all in PriParis-dechu!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.540
Right, Garuru?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:34.020
WAIT SHE'S NOT HERE-DECHU!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.750
Anyway, Capisce!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:45.390
We'll see you agian next week.

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.580
Let me fill you up-nekon.

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:08.240
Let the Meganii Summit begin.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.310
STYLISH

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.310
TOUGH

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.520
GUY!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.270
STYLISH

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.270
TOUGH

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.520
GUY!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.440
Here is today's topic.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:24.160
Divine Idol Grand Prix

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:28.620
The Divine Idol Grand Prix will be held.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:34.550
And so, Meganiis from around the world, you and your PriParas will...
